{"seq":1,"slug":"bytedance","title":"字节跳动","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":28,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.35,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"字节跳动-简介\">字节跳动 简介</h1><p>字节跳动是全球增长最快的科技公司之一，从今日头条到抖音、TikTok，再到飞书、火山引擎，其产品矩阵覆盖了内容分发、短视频社交、企业协作与云服务等多个领域。然而比产品本身更值得研究的，是支撑这一切高速增长的底层操作系统——字节跳动独特的企业文化与管理哲学。</p>\n<p>这套管理体系融合了硅谷互联网公司的开放基因与中国创业公司的执行力，形成了一套高度可复制、可规模化的组织运转逻辑。无论你是创业者、技术管理者，还是对组织文化感兴趣的研究者，都能从中获得关于如何在快速扩张中保持组织活力的启发。</p>\n<p>本知识库从四个维度解构字节跳动的管理实践。第一章<strong>文化与价值观</strong>深入剖析&quot;字节范&quot;六条行为准则、&quot;始终创业&quot;的反官僚文化，以及 Context not Control 的信息透明管理哲学。第二章<strong>绩效体系</strong>详解字节独特的 OKR 双月制、360 度环评机制，以及绩效与 OKR 解耦的设计逻辑。第三章<strong>组织与人才</strong>探讨网状组织结构、人才密度理念和信息透明文化如何协同运作。第四章<strong>战略与方法论</strong>分析 A/B 测试驱动的产品决策文化、全球化组织挑战，以及飞书如何成为文化的载体。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：如果你关注文化建设，从第一章开始系统阅读；如果你是管理者想借鉴具体制度设计，建议从第二章绩效体系切入；如果你对组织架构和人才策略感兴趣，直接进入第三章；如果你想了解字节的产品方法论和全球化经验，第四章是最佳起点。四章内容相互独立又彼此呼应，可根据自身需要灵活组合阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mission-and-vision","title":"字节跳动的使命与愿景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/culture-and-values/mission-and-vision"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bytedance-values-evolution","title":"字节范的演变：从旧六条到新六条","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/culture-and-values/bytedance-values-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"core-values-in-detail","title":"新字节范六条详解与行为准则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/culture-and-values/core-values-in-detail"},{"seq":4,"slug":"culture-in-practice","title":"字节跳动的文化落地机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/culture-and-values/culture-in-practice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"okr-practice","title":"字节跳动的 OKR 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/performance-system/okr-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"review","title":"360 度环评体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/performance-system/review"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-decoupling","title":"绩效与 OKR 解耦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/performance-system/performance-decoupling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mesh-organization","title":"网状组织结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/org-and-talent/mesh-organization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"talent-density","title":"人才密度理念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/org-and-talent/talent-density"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-transparency","title":"信息透明文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/org-and-talent/information-transparency"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ab-testing-culture","title":"A/B 测试驱动的产品文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/strategy-and-methodology/ab-testing-culture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-methodology","title":"全球化方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/strategy-and-methodology/global-methodology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feishu-as-culture","title":"飞书即文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/strategy-and-methodology/feishu-as-culture"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"职级体系与薪酬","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/bytedance/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"level-system-overview","title":"字节跳动职级体系全景",